# =============================================================================
# Runtime data (must NEVER live in the project root)
# =============================================================================
# The single data root is ~/.dunimd/encre (see harness/encre/paths.py).
# A project-local ./data tree only shows up when the server is run with
# ENCRE_DATA_DIR pointing here — stale dev state, not source.
/data/

# =============================================================================
# Local AI assistant rule files — ROOT ONLY, never **/AGENTS.md
# =============================================================================
# Root-scoped on purpose: a bare "AGENTS.md" also matches, case-insensitively
# on Windows, the tracked docs pages docs/help/agents.md + docs/help/en/agents.md
# and every skill's own AGENTS.md (harness/encre/skills/builtin/*/AGENTS.md).
# Those are committed content and must stay visible to `git add`.
/AGENTS.md
